          Hail!<br>
          <br>
          In assosiation with fellow trade-smith Servious, I am recruiting people interested in joining a new guild in Norath.  This guild, to be named 'Inner Circle', shall be a guild of Trade-smiths.  People actively trading, selling, or generally making a living off, the wares that they produce with their Trade Skills (Blacksmithing, Tailoring, Baking, Jeweling, etc.).<br>
          <br>
          Those interested should contact Rali, or Servious.  Initial members are required to be practiced in at least one Tradeskill and be able to show samples of their wares.  We will be limiting membership to exclude Necromancers and Shadow Knights.  Association with such riffraff is invariably bad for credibility and business.<br>
          <br>
          In addition, members are expected to conduct themselves in a mature and honorable fashion to keep our guilds name in high standing throughout the lands of Norath.  Members should be willing to assist other members in the accusition of raw materials and sale/trade of wares when possable, and when time permits.<br>
          <br>
          As a the guild is focused on the advancement of trades, we should view ourselves as Merchants, and conduct ourselves accordingly.  This means that the accrual of profits is our primary goal.  There is no such thing as a free lunch.<br>
          <br>
          As our numbers grow, we plan on holding events such as bake-offs, brewwing festivals, Weapon and Armor Markets, Raids, Quest Support, and possably even a guild sponsored Quests.  Interested parties are encouraged to contact myself, Rali, or Servious in game, or via email at mlchrist@yahoo.com<br>

